@startuml
title Browser abuse -> PoUW challenge -> access restored

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User
participant "Rate Limiter/Load Balancer\n(Traefik)" as RateLimiter
participant "Remediation Middleware\n(crowdsec-bouncer-traefik-plugin)" as Middleware
participant "Security Engine\n(CrowdSec)" as SecurityEngine
participant "Web Resource" as WebResource

participant "Worker Engine" as Worker
collections "PoUW Scripts\nRandomX.js/BTC Regtest\n(JS/WASM)" as Miner

participant "Worker Server" as WorkerServer
participant "Task Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Task Generator Interface" as TaskIF
participant "Result Service" as ResultService
participant "Validation Interface" as ValidationIF
participant "Custom Monero Stratum Adapter" as MoneroAdapter
participant "P2Pool Monero\n(RandomX Mining Pool)" as P2Pool

User -> RateLimiter: GET /
RateLimiter -> Middleware: browser-page-enforcement-chain
Middleware -> SecurityEngine: check remediation by source IP
SecurityEngine --> Middleware: captcha decision
Middleware --> User: serve challenge.html

User -> RateLimiter: GET /captcha-standalone.js
RateLimiter --> User: captcha JS bundle

User -> Worker: click "Solve Challenge"
Worker -> WorkerServer: GET /challenge?jobType=MONERO_RANDOMX
WorkerServer -> Orchestrator: createTask(workerId, jobType)
Orchestrator -> TaskIF: build task payload
TaskIF -> MoneroAdapter: getLatest() stratum job
MoneroAdapter --> TaskIF: RawStratumJob
TaskIF --> Orchestrator: MoneroRandomXTaskPayload
Orchestrator --> WorkerServer: Task(jobId, expiresAt, payload)
WorkerServer --> Worker: task JSON

Worker -> Miner: start RandomX mining
loop solving
Miner --> Worker: progress (hashrate, attempts)
end
Miner --> Worker: solution (nonce, hash)
Worker -> User: write hidden field "response" and submit form

User -> RateLimiter: POST challenge form (response)
RateLimiter -> Middleware: captcha validation flow
Middleware -> ResultService: POST /validate-custom-captcha
ResultService -> ValidationIF: verify task/result
ValidationIF -> MoneroAdapter: submitShare(stratumJobId, nonce, hash)
MoneroAdapter -> P2Pool: stratum submit
P2Pool --> MoneroAdapter: status=OK
MoneroAdapter --> ValidationIF: accepted
ValidationIF --> ResultService: ACCEPTED
ResultService --> Middleware: {"success": true}

Middleware --> User: set captcha pass (grace) + redirect to original URL
User -> RateLimiter: follow redirect GET /
RateLimiter -> Middleware: check pass/grace state
Middleware --> RateLimiter: allow
RateLimiter -> WebResource: forward request
WebResource --> User: 200 OK page

@enduml
